+// speedrun_skip_early, a setting of the game's (its ScummVM settings; unset: false): skips are pressed before the
+// segment start too, still only where a press has an effect. For a game whose boot reaches what its files do not hold
+// unless its intro is skipped: the MI2 non-interactive DOS demo with its playback off loads its intro's room, which
+// the demo does not hold. Never for Monkey Island (the logo speed glitch, above).
+static bool skipEarly() {
+	static int v = -1;
+	if (v < 0)
+		v = ConfMan.hasKey("speedrun_skip_early") && ConfMan.getBool("speedrun_skip_early") ? 1 : 0;
+	return v == 1;
+}
